:"<p>Discreet compartment to keep your AirTag tucked away for smart tracking without bulk.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":30,"horizontal":50,"vertical_mobile":40,"horizontal_mobile":56}},"content_6PY8cq":{"type":"content","settings":{"icon":"none","iwidth":"custom","icon_width":10,"heading":"Multifunctional Quick-Access Pocket","text":"<p>Perfect for cards, cables, or everyday essentials — quick to reach, easy to organize.<\/p>","link":"","color_text":"#ffffff","vertical":80,"horizontal":49,"vertical_mobile":58,"horizontal_mobile":59}}},"block_order":["content_6EMQjC","content_rAcVBC","content_Aewb4D","content_gKLaGN","content_6PY8cq"],"name":"t:sections.lookbook.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PC-UL1-B-1_c99df5e3-972e-4436-b630-ca14c927699b.jpg","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UL1-B-1_337256e8-a39d-40e7-9e67-4edd47c1cfaf.jpg","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-center md:items-center","heading_tag":"h2","heading_position":"none","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false,"color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":0,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":true,"rounded":false}},"faq_pkrCz4":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"question_VynyBf":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Can the Urban UL1 fit a camera?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. The main compartment is designed to accommodate compact cameras, point-and-shoot cameras, and everyday photography gear, while dedicated pockets keep SD cards, batteries, cables, and accessories organized.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_YfX4WV":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Is the Urban UL1 water-resistant?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Yes. Urban UL1 is made from premium 200D nylon with DuPont® water-repellent protection, combined with SBS® water-resistant zippers to help protect your gear from light rain, spills, and daily urban conditions.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_fpAF6k":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What makes the Urban UL1 different from a regular sling bag?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Unlike basic sling bags, Urban UL1 combines:<\/p><ul><li>Lightweight 395g carry<\/li><li>Camera-friendly organization<\/li><li>10-pocket storage system<\/li><li>Padded tablet protection<\/li><li>Hidden anti-theft pockets<\/li><li>Travel-ready detachable strap<\/li><li>Premium Duraflex® hardware and SBS® zippers<\/li><\/ul><p>This makes it an ideal EDC sling bag for urban travel, tech carry, and photography essentials.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_q83JhR":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>What situations is the Urban UL1 best for?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Urban UL1 performs best for:<\/p><ul><li>Daily commutingCity exploration<\/li><li>Travel and sightseeing<\/li><li>Photography walks<\/li><li>Coffee shop work sessions<\/li><li>Airport carry-on organization<\/li><li>Weekend outings<\/li><li>Minimalist everyday carry<\/li><\/ul><p>Its compact profile and organized layout help you move through the city efficiently while keeping essential gear protected and accessible.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}},"question_CKQ7dG":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"<strong>Choose UL1 or UL2?<\/strong>","text":"<p>Choose <a href=\"\/products\/urban-ul1-sling-bag-white\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban UL1 Sling Bag-White\">UL1<\/a> for more capacity and camera organization. <br\/>Choose <a href=\"\/products\/urban-ul2-sling-bag\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Urban UL2 Sling Bag-White\">UL2<\/a> for a smaller 3.3L profile and side-pleat flexibility.<\/p>","highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle"}}},"block_order":["question_VynyBf","question_YfX4WV","question_fpAF6k","question_q83JhR","question_CKQ7dG"],"name":"t:sections.faq.name","settings":{"style":"with-background","heading":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS","heading_size":"title-sm","heading_alignment":"text-left md:items-end md:flex-row","heading_tag":"h2","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false,"color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#ffffff","overlay_opacity":4,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"narrow":false,"rounded":false}},"lookbook_RawUtM":{"type":"lookbook","disabled":true,"name":"t:sections.lookbook.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PC-UL1-B_fe564d94-9bf9-4aca-a9f9-471f6bf4ea13.jpg","image_mobile":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/UL1-B_1aa77650-6128-47cf-9ddc-51cc7b6b8958.jpg","heading":"","heading_size":"title-md","heading_alignment":"text-center md:items-center","heading_tag":"h2","heading_position":"none","subheading":"","description":"","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_external":false,"button_icon":true,"highlighted_text":"none","highlighted_scribble":"circle","highlighted_reveal":false,"color_text":"","color_background":"","gradient_background":"","color_highlight":"","gradient_highlight":"","color_button_text":"","color_button_background":"","color_button_gradient":"","color_overlay":"#171717","overlay_opacity":30,"padding_top":0,"padding_bottom":0,"divider":false,"full_width":true,"rounded":false}},"video_with_text_7cmAkj":{"type":"video-with-text","blocks":{"heading_3d3CXJ":{"type":"heading","settings":{"headin